<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch govt sees lower 1997 borrowing requirement.</title>
<headline>Dutch govt sees lower 1997 borrowing requirement.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch government said on Friday a large reduction in a cash reserve previously held with the central bank would reduce the amount it needs to borrow on the capital market in 1997 by 14.35 billion guilders.</p>
</text>
